# Optimistic concurrency on parts: PUT needs the version of the last response (missing or 0 is 422); a stale one is 409
# with part_version_conflict, and the version of a fresh re-read succeeds. One disposable row, deleted at the end.

@AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress = {{$processEnv AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}
@WebUI_Origin = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_WEBUI_ORIGIN}}
@AdminEmail = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_EMAIL}}
@AdminPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_PASSWORD}}
@RunId = {{$timestamp}}
@Key = ZZC{{RunId}}P

### [Setup][Parts] Clear any session cookie left by a previous file (204 or 401, not asserted)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

###

### [Setup][Parts] Login as admin (MechanicOnly prerequisite)
# @name csrfSource1
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{AdminEmail}}", "password": "{{AdminPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-arsm-csrf-token='))?.match(/^__Host-arsm-csrf-token=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Setup][Parts] Create the disposable part (201 expected)
# @name concPart
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{Key}}", "name": "Concurrency Fixture", "netUnitPrice": 100, "vatRatePercent": 27 }

?? status == 201

###

### [Negative][Parts] Update without a version is rejected (422 expected)
PUT {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts/{{concPart.id}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{Key}}", "name": "Concurrency No Version", "netUnitPrice": 100, "vatRatePercent": 27 }

?? status == 422
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "Version is required.") == true

###

### [Negative][Parts] Update with version 0 is rejected (422 expected)
PUT {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts/{{concPart.id}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{Key}}", "name": "Concurrency Zero Version", "netUnitPrice": 100, "vatRatePercent": 27, "version": 0 }

?? status == 422
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "Version is required.") == true

###

### [Positive][Parts] Update with the version of the last response succeeds (204 expected)
PUT {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts/{{concPart.id}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{Key}}", "name": "Concurrency Updated", "netUnitPrice": 100, "vatRatePercent": 27, "version": {{concPart.version}} }

?? status == 204

###

### [Positive][Parts] Re-read carries a new version (200 expected)
# @name rereadPart
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts/{{concPart.id}}

?? status == 200
?? js (response.parsedBody.version != concPart.version) == true

###

### [Negative][Parts] Replaying the old version is stale (409 expected, body {"code":"part_version_conflict"})
PUT {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts/{{concPart.id}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{Key}}", "name": "Concurrency Stale", "netUnitPrice": 100, "vatRatePercent": 27, "version": {{concPart.version}} }

?? status == 409
?? js response.parsedBody.code == part_version_conflict

###

### [Positive][Parts] The stale write was not applied (200 expected, name and version are those of the last good update)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts/{{concPart.id}}

?? status == 200
?? js (response.parsedBody.name === "Concurrency Updated") == true
?? js (response.parsedBody.version == rereadPart.version) == true

###

### [Positive][Parts] The re-read version updates again (204 expected)
PUT {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts/{{concPart.id}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{Key}}", "name": "Concurrency Recovered", "netUnitPrice": 100, "vatRatePercent": 27, "version": {{rereadPart.version}} }

?? status == 204

###

### [Positive][Parts] The recovered write is stored under yet another version (200 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts/{{concPart.id}}

?? status == 200
?? js (response.parsedBody.name === "Concurrency Recovered") == true
?? js (response.parsedBody.version != rereadPart.version) == true

###

### [Cleanup][Parts] Delete the disposable part (204 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts/{{concPart.id}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204
